00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:09.260
So this is a high
level agenda of what

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.090
I'm going to talk about.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:13.900
The first half of
the session, I'm

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.750
going to be focusing primarily
on what we're doing on GCP.

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.280
And then I'm going to turn
it over to our partners

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.220
who we announced
