problems or intrusions

00:39:42.340 --> 00:39:45.620
you are concerned about in
your public cloud offerings.

00:39:45.620 --> 00:39:48.940
And they apply seamlessly
and transparently across all

00:39:48.940 --> 00:39:50.796
